"Oops, you're creating an authorization to send from %(email_login)s but your"
" address is %(email_server)s. Make sure your addresses match!"
msgstr ""
"Ups, vytvárate oprávnenie na odosielanie z adresy %(email_login)s, ale vaša "
"adresa je %(email_server)s. Skontrolujte, či sa adresy zhodujú!"

